<title>SWEDEN: Swedish Jan c/a surplus 6.2 bln crowns - Riksbank.</title>
<headline>Swedish Jan c/a surplus 6.2 bln crowns - Riksbank.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1997-03-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sweden's January current account showed a surplus of 6.2 billion crowns for a surplus of 37.0 billion in the 12 months to January, the central bank (Riksbank) said on Wednesday.</p>
</text>
